    "body": "@tabatkins @svgeesus I think that definition may be overly broad. \n\nPreviously, it was decided that relative font units would be calculated in the absence of shaping - https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5498, so I think any property that only effects shaping should be excluded.  \n\nAdditionally, `line-height` should be excluded, as CSS Values explicitly calls out that it can depend on font-relative units of the element itself.\n\nOne additional property that needs exploring is [`zoom`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-viewport/#zoom-property). I have filed https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14260 on that particular issue.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
